      "content": "During Lantern Rite events (limited-time) Andrei's dialogue stops changing between day and night. He says it is his first Lantern Rite, is fascinated by the size of the Mingxiao Lantern, and then reminds himself that he must stay loyal to the Tsaritsa. In later festival variants he turns away business to enjoy the sea breeze, the Xiao Lanterns, music or kites.",
